{
  "annotations": {"list": [{"builtIn": 1, "datasource": {"type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --"}, "enable": true, "hide": true, "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)", "name": "Annotations & Alerts", "type": "dashboard"}]},
  "description": "La cadena que convierte una alerta en un mensaje en el móvil. Es la parte del sistema que no falla de forma visible: si se rompe, todo lo demás sigue verde y las alertas siguen saliendo, pero nadie las recibe.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [{"asDropdown": true, "icon": "external link", "includeVars": false, "keepTime": true, "tags": ["noc"], "targetBlank": false, "title": "Ir a...", "type": "dashboards", "url": ""}],
  "panels": [
    { "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Puente de notificaciones",
      "description": "Último resultado de entrega por destino. 1 = entregado, 0 = fallando. Es la serie que dispara CanalNotificacionCaido. Si el puente responde y esto está en rojo, el problema son las credenciales o el destino, no la conectividad.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"mappings": [{"options": {"0": {"color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "FALLANDO"}}, "type": "value"}, {"options": {"1": {"color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "Correcto"}}, "type": "value"}], "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "auto"},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "ntfy_bridge_delivery_success", "legendFormat": "{{sink}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tiempo en marcha del puente",
      "description": "Si esta cifra no se reinicia de golpe, el puente lleva vivo todo el rato. Sus reinicios frecuentes no generan alertas: es exactamente el fallo que un servicio no puede detectar sobre sí mismo, así que se vigila desde fuera.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "mappings": [{"options": {}, "type": "value"}], "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "text", "value": null}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "auto"},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "ntfy_bridge_uptime_seconds", "legendFormat": "en marcha", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alertas activas por severidad",
      "description": "La métrica ALERTS del propio Prometheus. Muestra la forma del incidente: un pico de críticas que se resuelve solo suele ser un reinicio; uno que se mantiene es una avería real.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "normal"}}, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (alertstate) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})", "legendFormat": "{{alertstate}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones al puente, por resultado",
      "description": "ok / error / rejected. 'error' son lotes que el puente no pudo entregar; 'rejected' son peticiones que fallaron la validación o la autenticación. Un 'rejected' que crece sin tráfico entrante significa que Alertmanager las está rechazando.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "normal"}}, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (result) (ntfy_bridge_http_requests_by_result_total)", "legendFormat": "{{result}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo de entrega de la notificación",
      "description": "Latencia entre que Alertmanager entrega el lote y que el puente termina. Si crece, la cadena de notificación se degrada aunque las alertas sigan saliendo.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["max", "mean"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "rate(ntfy_bridge_delivery_duration_seconds_sum[5m]) / rate(ntfy_bridge_delivery_duration_seconds_count[5m])", "legendFormat": "media", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Entregas por destino y resultado",
      "description": "`ok` / `failed` acumulados. Un `failed` que sube sin un `ok` que lo iguale es un destino roto desde hace rato, aunque el indicador de arriba se recuperara en el último intento.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "normal"}}, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (sink, result) (ntfy_bridge_deliveries_total)", "legendFormat": "{{sink}} / {{result}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    },
    { "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reintentos de entrega",
      "description": "Reintentos acumulados por destino. Un valor que no deja de subir significa que el destino responde lento o con errores intermitentes: la alerta llega, pero tarde.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "pointSize": 5, "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "normal"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [ {"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "bridge"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (sink) (ntfy_bridge_delivery_retries_total)", "legendFormat": "{{sink}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"} ]
    }
  ],
